[{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0043","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49476","title":"Linux kernel mt7921 WiFi 驱动释放后使用导致内核空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mt76 无线驱动中的 mt7921 芯片驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞。在设备移除流程中，mt7921_pci_remove 函数过早释放 mt76 设备结构体，导致 devm_free_irq 尚未完成时 mt7921_irq_handler 中断处理函数仍可能被调用，从而访问已释放的内存触发内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过热拔插或驱动解绑操作利用该漏洞，造成拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，中等危害。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49476"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:10Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.14、5.18.3 或 5.19 及以上版本，包含提交 ad483ed9dd51 的补丁。该修复将 mt76_free_device 延迟至 devm_free_irq 完成后执行，避免设备移除时中断处理程序访问已释放的内存导致空指针解引用崩溃。如无法立即升级，可避免在系统运行中热拔插或 unbind mt7921 无线网卡设备作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/09693f5b636fb3f6dd56fd943226fc1bbc600b51","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/677e669973bf5460705bc65033445ea9f6615999","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ad483ed9dd5193a54293269c852a29051813b7bd","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49476.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49476","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49476.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49476.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49476.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-h9m4-2235-4mrh/GHSA-h9m4-2235-4mrh.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49476","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49476.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--609b98d9-d3fd-4e02-90e8-bda5e895c124.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49476"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0042","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49471","title":"Linux rtw89 无线驱动 CFO 处理数组越界访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 rtw89 无线网卡驱动的 CFO（载波频率偏移）解析函数存在数组越界访问漏洞。硬件可上报非法的 mac_id（如索引 188），而 `rtw89_phy_cfo_parse` 函数在访问固定大小为 64 的数组前未进行边界校验，导致越界内存读写。本地攻击者可通过连接恶意 Wi-Fi 设备发送特制无线数据包触发此漏洞，造成内核崩溃或内存信息泄露，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Linux 社区已通过添加 mac_id 边界检查修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49471"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:08Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 5.17.14、5.18.3 或更高版本，其中已为 rtw89 驱动的 CFO 处理逻辑添加 mac_id 边界检查。如无法立即升级内核，可通过黑名单禁用 rtw89_pci 内核模块（echo 'blacklist rtw89_pci' > /etc/modprobe.d/rtw89-blacklist.conf）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03ed236480aeec8c2fd327a1ea6d711364c495e3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/97df85871a5b187609d30fca6d85b912d9e02f29","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c32fafe68298bb599e825c298e1d0ba30186f0a5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49471.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49471.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49471.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49471","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49471.md","https://github.com/ctrliq/advisories/blob/b05bfbc3a1de170377430c48777435c2cc639f64/csaf/vex/cve/2022/cve-2022-49471.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-9262-x6ph-8rp3/GHSA-9262-x6ph-8rp3.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49471","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49471.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--caa153a7-1f7d-4ddd-9c41-1680b3023f9d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0042.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0041","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49469","title":"Linux btrfs 子卷创建时匿名设备资源泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统驱动中存在匿名设备号（anon_dev）内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401）。在 create_subvol() 函数创建子卷过程中，当 btrfs_qgroup_inherit()、btrfs_alloc_tree_block() 或 btrfs_insert_root() 等内部函数调用失败时，代码直接返回而未释放已分配的 anon_dev 资源，导致内核内存泄漏。本地攻击者可通过反复触发子卷创建操作耗尽系统内存，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响主流 Linux 发行版内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。开发者已通过重构错误处理逻辑在对应内核版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49469"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:08Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核到 5.17.14、5.18.3 或更高版本（如 5.19 及后续 LTS 版本），其中已包含修复提交 d887b3de3188。该补丁在 create_subvol() 函数中补全了 btrfs_qgroup_inherit()、btrfs_alloc_tree_block() 等调用失败时 anon_dev 的释放路径，消除内存泄漏导致的本地拒绝服务风险。无法立即升级时，可通过限制本地用户对 btrfs 子卷创建操作的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2256e901f5bddc56e24089c96f27b77da932dfcc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a875ad8706f0903a0e812e0dd701956ee9826ff","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d887b3de318834f9aa637ecf79c6bc66cba7c69a","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49469.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49469.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49469","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49469.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49469.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-fh4q-xrmp-hv9j/GHSA-fh4q-xrmp-hv9j.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49469.html","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49469","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68681.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--85efeeff-2c98-4001-9bf5-cbebd1d2cc60.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0040","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49465","title":"Linux 内核 blk-throttle 使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核块层限流模块（blk-throttle）存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当 BIO（块 I/O 请求）需要被限流时，内核启用了定时器并设置 BIO_THROTTLED 标志，但若在定时器到期前该 BIO 已完成并释放，定时器回调函数 `blk_throtl_dispatch_work_fn()` 继续访问已释放的 BIO，导致释放后使用。本地攻击者可通过精心构造的 I/O 操作序列触发该竞态条件，造成系统崩溃或潜在权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。官方已通过将 BIO_THROTTLED 设置移入队列锁（queue_lock）修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49465"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下修复版本：5.10.248、5.15.198、5.17.14 或 5.18.3 及以上版本。该漏洞通过将 BIO_THROTTLED 标志的设置移入 queue_lock 中修复，避免 bio 完成后的 use-after-free 问题。如无法立即升级，可禁用块层限流功能（通过设置 /sys/block/*/queue/throttle_sample_group 为 0）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/047ea38d41d90d748bca812a43339632f52ba715","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0cfc8a0fb07cde61915e4a77c4794c47de3114a4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/24ba80efaf6e772f6132465fad08e20fb4767da7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5a011f889b4832aa80c2a872a5aade5c48d2756f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/935fa666534d7b7185e8c6b0191cd06281be4290","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49465.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49465","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49465.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49465.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49465.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-xp9j-268q-p7q6/GHSA-xp9j-268q-p7q6.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49465","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49465.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58998.json","https://github.com/bottlerocket-os/bottlerocket-kernel-kit/blob/f0477bb907bdf8f44b2428131e7b4ebefe094480/advisories/2.3.2/BRSA-e8gvjo9xlq7a.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0039","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49420","title":"Linux Kernel UDP sk_bound_dev_if 条件竞争漏洞","description":"Linux 内核网络子系统中 udpv6_sendmsg 函数与 `__ip6_datagram_connect` 函数之间存在数据竞争（data race）漏洞。当 UDP 套接字在调用 sendmsg 发送数据时，会无锁读取 `sk->sk_bound_dev_if` 字段，而此时另一线程可能通过 connect 系统调用并发写入该字段，导致读取到不一致的数据。该漏洞由内核并发消毒器（KCSAN）检测发现，可能引发未定义行为或内存访问异常。攻击者可通过精心构造的多线程程序触发竞争条件，在特定场景下造成信息泄露或系统不稳定。影响 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49420"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:18:00Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.3 或更高版本（含对应 stable 分支补丁），补丁提交为 4c971d2f3548 和 20b2f6179787。若无法立即更新，可通过内核启动参数 `kcsan.enabled=0` 临时关闭 KCSAN 检测以消除告警，但这仅为排查手段，长期仍需升级内核彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/20b2f61797873a2b18b5ff1a304ad2674fa1e0a5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4c971d2f3548e4f11b1460ac048f5307e4b39fdb","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49420.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49420.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49420","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49420.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49420.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-h3wv-rxr8-rgrg/GHSA-h3wv-rxr8-rgrg.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49420.html","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49420","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49420.md","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68621.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0038","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49390","title":"Linux Kernel macsec 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 MACsec 驱动中存在释放后使用（UAF）漏洞。创建 macsec 虚拟设备时未增加对 real_dev（底层物理设备）的引用计数，导致 real_dev 被提前释放后 macsec 设备仍可访问其内存，从而触发 UAF。本地攻击者可通过顺序创建和删除特制的 macsec 设备导致内核内存破坏，可能实现权限提升或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49390"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:54Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.17.15、5.18.3 或 5.19 及以上版本。如无法升级内核，可手动应用补丁：在 drivers/net/macsec.c 的 macsec_dev_init() 中添加 dev_hold_track(real_dev)，在 macsec_free_netdev() 中添加 dev_put_track(real_dev)，确保 macsec 设备对 real_dev 持有引用计数，避免释放后使用。补丁参考 git.kernel.org 稳定树提交 196a888ca657、78933cbc143b、d130282179aa。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/196a888ca6571deb344468e1d7138e3273206335","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/78933cbc143b82d02330e00900d2fd08f2682f4e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d130282179aa6051449ac8f8df1115769998a665","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49390.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49390.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49390","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49390.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49390.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-w9jf-hmj5-fp54/GHSA-w9jf-hmj5-fp54.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49390","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5fc355d60e5d1a1fefefacd0202b767223ed6ef1/usn/7922-5.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49390.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1dd8fbbb-2a94-4a12-b123-840f68a439ae.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0037","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49359","title":"Linux Kernel Panfrost DRM 驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 drm/panfrost 驱动中发现一处释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。该驱动中 job 结构体通过引用 panfrost_priv 来获取 MMU 上下文，但在某些场景下 MMU 上下文的生命周期可以超过对应的 panfrost_priv，当 panfrost_priv 被释放后，job 仍尝试访问已释放的内存区域，从而触发释放后使用漏洞。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统崩溃或潜在权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49359"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:49Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.18 或更高版本，或更新至发行版提供的已包含此补丁的内核（如 Ubuntu 22.04 的 5.15.0-xx、Debian 的 5.10.y 稳定更新）。若无法立即升级，可禁用 Panfrost DRM 驱动模块（modprobe -r panfrost）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/472dd7ea5e19a1aeabf1711ddc756777e05ee7c2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6e516faf04317db2c46cbec4e3b78b4653a5b109","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8c8e8cc91a6ffc79865108279a74fd57d9070a17","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49359.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49359.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49359","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49359.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49359.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-gvx3-72r6-pv8h/GHSA-gvx3-72r6-pv8h.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49359","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49359.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-59142.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2022-49359"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0035","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49333","title":"Linux Kernel mlx5 E-Switch 设备配对时未持有锁拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Mellanox MLX5 网卡驱动 E-Switch 模块中存在锁机制缺陷，mlx5_get_next_phys_dev() 函数在未持有接口锁的情况下被调用，导致在配对不支持链路聚合（LAG）的设备时触发内核告警（WARNING），造成系统拒绝服务。本地攻击者可通过 devlink 命令触发 eswitch 模式切换操作利用该漏洞，影响使用 MLX5 网卡的 Linux 系统。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49333"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:44Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.19 或对应的修复版本 5.17.15/5.18.4，其中已合入提交 cdbcdddb8076/3008e6a0049，在 E-Switch offloads 配对时增加 LAG 能力检查，避免在不支持 LAG 的设备上调用 mlx5_get_next_phys_dev() 触发内核 WARNING。如无法立即升级，可暂时关闭 ConnectX 系列的 E-Switch offloads 功能（devlink dev eswitch set pci/<dev> mode legacy）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0cef0b7eb044bb8cfdaff4c1db55a8fd442f6bc9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3008e6a0049361e731b803c60fe8f3ab44e1d73f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cdbcdddb8076a09aa6ddaf20fd911fc787dca0e5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49333.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49333","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49333.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49333.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-7gw7-9782-f2m2/GHSA-7gw7-9782-f2m2.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49333.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49333.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49333","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68618.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49333.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0034","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49317","title":"Linux 内核 f2fs 节点页刷新无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 F2FS（Flash-Friendly File System）文件系统在刷新节点页时存在无限循环漏洞。当底层存储设备持续返回 I/O 错误（EIO）时，f2fs_flush_node_pages 函数无法正确退出循环，导致内核陷入死循环，系统资源被耗尽，最终引发拒绝服务。本地攻击者可通过触发特定文件系统操作（如 xfstests generic/475 测试用例）利用此漏洞，造成系统无响应。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核使用 F2FS 文件系统的版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49317"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:41Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.4 或更高版本（例如 5.19+），其中已合入修复 f2fs 节点页刷写无限循环的补丁（commit bd47ea5d776d）。如无法立即升级内核，可通过避免在不可靠存储设备（如频繁出现 EIO 错误的磁盘）上使用 f2fs 文件系统来降低触发风险，或在生产环境中禁用 f2fs 文件系统支持（从内核模块 blacklist 中移除 f2fs）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a7b8618aa2f0f926ce85f2486ac835a85c753ca7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bd47ea5d776d8b524fb6f60de3240f95603901dd","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49317.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49317.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49317.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49317","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49317.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-45xf-wh8j-3x9p/GHSA-45xf-wh8j-3x9p.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-49317","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49317.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d835aadd-ccdb-40c4-ac89-413f4e42f0e4.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-49317"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0033","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49306","title":"Linux USB DWC3 主机 ACPI 伴生对象设置不当导致资源泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 USB DWC3 驱动的主机模式存在资源管理缺陷，在设置 ACPI companion 时会意外替换父设备 dwc3 的 fwnode->secondary 指针，导致资源泄漏等潜在副作用。本地攻击者可利用已获得的最低权限触发该漏洞，影响系统稳定性。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中。Linux 主线内核已在提交中移除此操作修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49306"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:39Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.17.15、5.18.4 或更新版本（5.19+）。各长期支持发行版请安装对应的稳定内核更新包，例如 Ubuntu 通过 apt upgrade 更新 linux-image 包，RHEL/CentOS 通过 yum update kernel 获取修复。该漏洞由 dwc3 主机驱动中错误设置 ACPI companion 导致 fwnode 指针意外覆盖，可能引发资源泄漏，无法通过配置缓解，必须更新内核修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7fd069d65da2e20b1caec3b7bcf9dfbe28c04bb2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9c185fde906a48368bd2d2a8c17d4b6fb3d670af","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d7f35934f7ab67bfd9adabc84207e59da9c19108","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49306.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49306.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49306.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49306","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49306.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-5h2r-p6h6-8p2x/GHSA-5h2r-p6h6-8p2x.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49306.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49306","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49306.md","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68615.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0031","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49296","title":"Linux kernel Ceph 文件系统死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 Ceph 文件系统存在死锁漏洞，当客户端以 wsync 模式挂载后，创建 O_RDWR 文件时 inline_version 被错误初始化为 1，随后立即进行缓冲写入操作时，客户端已持有 Fwb  caps 锁并等待 getattr(Fsr) 请求完成，而 MDS 节点间因文件锁状态转换需要回收 Fxwb caps，形成循环等待导致死锁。本地攻击者可通过构造特定的文件操作序列触发此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 Ceph 文件系统模块，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49296"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:37Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.4 或更高版本（5.19+ 已包含主线修复），或向后移植补丁 commit 825978fd6a0defc3c29d8a38b6cea76a0938d21e（稳定分支）与 292b7a7275ce（主线分支）。作为临时缓解措施，避免使用 wsync 挂载选项挂载 CephFS，并在创建 O_RDWR 文件后避免立即执行缓冲区写入操作，减少触发死锁的条件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/292b7a7275ce535a1abfa4dd0b2e586162aaae1e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/825978fd6a0defc3c29d8a38b6cea76a0938d21e","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49296.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49296.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49296.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49296","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49296.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2025/04/GHSA-gcr7-hvf6-ph59/GHSA-gcr7-hvf6-ph59.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49296","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49296.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-60327.json","https://github.com/begumsozer/Atelier_Data_Project/blob/c180b70b99084444dad46b49963b14f4cf496528/cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0030","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49267","title":"Linux MMC 核心子系统 sysfs_emit 安全加固改进","description":"该漏洞涉及 Linux 内核 MMC（多媒体卡）核心子系统中将 `sprintf()` 替换为 `sysfs_emit()` 的代码改进。`sprintf()` 在 sysfs 显示函数中使用时存在缓冲区安全问题，而 `sysfs_emit()` 是内核提供的安全替代函数，可避免缓冲区溢出风险。该 CVE 已被 CVE 编号机构撤销/拒绝，并非实际安全漏洞，CVSS 评分为 0，不影响任何产品版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49267"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:03Z","updated":"2026-03-24T09:16:18Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 v5.18 及以上版本，该版本已合入上游提交 f5d8a5fe77ce 将 MMC 核心驱动中所有 sprintf() 替换为安全的 sysfs_emit()。对于无法升级内核的发行版，可反向移植该单个提交到当前内核源码的 drivers/mmc/core/ 目录下。临时缓解措施可限制本地用户对 /sys/bus/mmc/ 目录的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49267.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49267.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2022-49267.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2022-49267","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49267.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49267.html","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-49267","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8abbbbfccc62b03a7c5dde9955bcc61f3c1b4ea9/osv/usn/USN-8060-6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-49267.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-68612.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0029","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49234","title":"Linux 内核 DSA 跨芯片 VLAN 过滤同步数组越界读取漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DSA（分布式交换架构）子系统中存在越界读取漏洞。在多芯片级联交换网络拓扑中，当某交换机端口离开桥接时，VLAN 过滤同步机制会错误地向其他交换芯片发送跨芯片通知，导致使用不存在的端口号进行数组越界访问（CWE-125），引发内核崩溃。攻击者可通过构造特定的网络配置触发该漏洞，实现拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49234"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:01:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:27Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.17.2 及以上版本，该版本已合入修复补丁。补丁提交为主线 e1f2a4dd8d43 和稳定分支 108dc8741c20，修复了 dsa_port_vlan_filtering 函数在跨芯片通知场景下使用无效端口号导致数组越界的问题。各 Linux 发行版用户应参照发行商安全公告更新内核包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T11:56:42Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0028","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49218","title":"Linux 内核 DRM/DP 越界读取漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM/DP 驱动的 drm_dp_get_adjust_request_post_cursor 函数中，link_status 数组长度不足（仅 6 字节），但在处理 Post Cursor2 寄存器调整请求时尝试访问越界下标（下标 10），导致越界读取（OOB Read）漏洞。本地攻击者可通过触发 DisplayPort 协商过程利用该漏洞读取内核内存敏感信息，影响使用 Linux 内核的各类系统。该漏洞由 -Warray-bounds 编译时发现，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49218"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:25Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 5.17.2 及以上版本（5.17 稳定版已包含修复提交 aeaed9a9fe69）或 5.18 及以上版本（主线修复提交 a2151490cc6c），或 cherry-pick 上述提交到当前内核。该漏洞由 drm_dp_get_adjust_request_post_cursor 函数中 link_status 数组空间不足导致在处理 Post Cursor2 寄存器时发生越界读取，修复已移除该辅助函数并改用内联方式读取解码。如无法立即升级内核，可在 BIOS 层面禁用受影响硬件的 DisplayPort 输出作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a2151490cc6c57b368d7974ffd447a8b36ade639","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aeaed9a9fe694f8b1462fb81e2d33298c929180b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49218.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49218.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3de260baf5452671b1860955d9815c2cdbc09bef/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49218.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49218","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49218.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-5876-wpj2-hw48/GHSA-5876-wpj2-hw48.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49218","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-49218.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-58832.json","https://github.com/fderuiter/lambda-wave/blob/352d151151b3004e320d909f59dc8b1fa30f2838/.trivyignore"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0027","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-49178","title":"Linux Kernel memstick/mspro_block 只读设备处理不当导致资源泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 memstick/mspro_block 驱动在处理只读存储设备时存在引用泄漏漏洞（CWE-401）。驱动程序未使用 set_disk_ro 将只读状态正确传播到块设备层，而是在 ->open 函数中进行检查，导致在访问只读设备时引用计数泄漏，进而可能引发内核内存资源耗尽。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-49178"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T07:00:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:17:17Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.10.110、5.15.33、5.16.19、5.17.2 及以上版本，或合入 commit 40f2c71b2f6a 补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过模块黑名单临时禁用 memstick 内核模块（执行 echo \"blacklist memstick\" >> /etc/modprobe.d/disable-memstick.conf 并重启）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/057b53c4f87690d626203acef8b63d52a9bf2f43","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6a0725b9d78ff6efdc95a37e4f05072e79c63918","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6dab421bfe06a59bf8f212a72e34673e8acf2018","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2022/49xxx/CVE-2022-49178.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-49178.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2022-49178","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2022-49178.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-49178.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-wv38-qg96-rhr3/GHSA-wv38-qg96-rhr3.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-49178.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-49178","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-67682.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--99cb5281-eeb5-4193-bf46-a8277a965cc2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0027.toml"}]